NOTICE

This archive is the mltrs Roc platform for Linux x86-64. It carries the
platform's own code, four generated stub libraries, and copies of files from
the toolchain that built it. Each section below names the files it covers and
the licence text in LICENSES/ that applies.

LICENSES/SOURCES.txt records the source package and version of every
third-party file. LICENSES/rust-crates.txt records every rust crate in the
dependency graph with the licence its manifest declares.

