2. The stub shared objects
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files:  targets/x64glibc/libc.so, libm.so, libgcc_s.so, libvulkan.so

These carry no upstream code. The generator reads each symbol name and each
data-object size from the system libraries, then emits a `ret` for every
function and a zero-filled block for every object. Section 1 licenses them.

