5. Libraries linked into libhost.a
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
File: targets/x64glibc/libhost.a

The host archive statically links C, C++ and rust libraries. The archive
therefore contains their object code.

  SDL3                     Zlib
                           LICENSES/SDL3-Zlib.txt
  slang                    Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
                           LICENSES/slang-slang-LICENSE
  glslang, SPIRV-Tools,    bundled inside slang; each licence text is a
  SPIRV-Headers, miniz,    LICENSES/slang-* file
  lz4, cmark-gfm,
  fast_float,
  unordered_dense
  rust crates              MIT, Apache-2.0, Zlib, BSD-3-Clause and
                           Unlicense, per crate
                           LICENSES/rust-crates.txt

The Vulkan loader is not linked. The host reaches it through the
`libvulkan.so` stub in section 2 and the system's own `libvulkan.so.1`.
